{
  "tema": 5920,
  "slug": "pidio-pidieron",
  "titulo": "Pedir in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Pedí tacos y Beto pidió una torta.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Pedir changes e to i in the preterite only in the third person: pedí, pediste, pidió, pedimos, pidieron. Yo, tú and nosotros stay regular.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Pedir** (_to ask for, to order_) takes the regular -ir preterite endings, with one change: **e → i** in the **third person** only."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Preterite of pedir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "pedí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "pediste"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**pidió**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "pedimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "**pidieron**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "This is different from the present, where the change is in almost every form (**pido, pides, pide, piden**). In the preterite, **yo** is **pedí**, with e."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Pedimos** is the same in the present and the preterite; context tells you which."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Other verbs work the same way: **servir** (sirvió), **repetir** (repitió), **seguir** (siguió), **vestir** (vistió)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: only **he, she** and **they** get the **i**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Anoche ==pedí== tacos de birria.",
              "en": "Last night I ordered birria tacos."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Qué ==pediste== en el restaurante?",
              "en": "What did you order at the restaurant?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto ==pidió== una torta y un agua de horchata.",
              "en": "Beto ordered a torta and a horchata."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Pedimos== la cuenta a las once.",
              "en": "We asked for the check at eleven."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis papás me ==pidieron== ayuda con el huerto.",
              "en": "My parents asked me for help with the garden."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ya ==pidieron==?",
              "en": "Have you all ordered yet?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi coach me ==pidió== más intensidad.",
              "en": "My coach asked me for more intensity."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
